  "description": "Easily manage cookies in Blazor WebAssembly with the BrowserCookieStorageService. This package simplifies working with cookies by allowing you to set, retrieve, and remove cookies directly from Blazor applications using JavaScript interop. Designed for .NET 9, this library integrates seamlessly with modern Blazor WebAssembly projects.",
